          X
          Tx
          x0
          x1
          alpha
          x'
          Hx').
        reflexivity.
      }
      rewrite Hy'Expand.
      claim HrevBetaHom2 :
        path_homotopic
          X
          Tx
          x0
          x1
          (reverse_path beta)
          alpha.
