    E
    Te
    B
    Tb
    p
    e0
    b0
    ft
    Hcov
    He0
    Hb0
    Hpe0
    Hlift
    Hft0).
}
exact (Hconst 1 one_in_unit_interval).
Qed.

(** Infrastructure: path_lift of a constant path is pointwise constant **)
