  f
  HfCont
  HnoFixAll).
Qed.

(** Infrastructure: fixed points exist on every retract of B^2. **)
(** Proven Charlie **)
Theorem s55_retract_B2_fixed_point_early : forall A:set,
  retraction_of B2 B2_topology A ->
